OL,5,G0455 Fletchers' Family Farm
OL,6,     FOn her morning rounds, Liz takes a
OL,7,     Fmoment to appreciate the life the
OL,8,     Ffamily have built on the farm, but
OL,9,     Ftheir peaceful routine is
OL,10,     Finterrupted when calf Elizabeth
OL,11,     Fdevelops a worrying wheeze.
